# Task 151-003 Execution Plan — ChatPage.tsx (7th Dashboard Page)

## Approach
Build ChatPage with 4 sub-components inline (ChatInput, ChatHistory, NotificationPanel, TaskContextSidebar).
Use existing patterns: useSSE hook for SSE, fetchJson/postJson for API, i18n for translations, Tailwind dark theme.

## Files to Create/Modify
1. `src/dashboard/src/pages/ChatPage.tsx` — NEW: Full chat page with 4 components
2. `src/dashboard/src/App.tsx` — ADD: `/chat` route + import
3. `src/dashboard/src/components/Layout.tsx` — ADD: Chat nav item
4. `src/dashboard/src/i18n/en.ts` — ADD: chat.* translation keys
5. `src/dashboard/src/i18n/tr.ts` — ADD: chat.* translation keys (Turkish)
6. `tests/dashboard/chat-page.test.tsx` — NEW: 5+ tests

## Design
- ChatInput: Textarea + Send button, calls POST /api/chat with message
- ChatHistory: Scrollable message list, user/assistant bubbles
- NotificationPanel: SSE /api/events filtered for NOTIFY events, last 10
- TaskContextSidebar: Shows running task status from SSE data
- Layout: 2-column on desktop (chat left, sidebar right), stacked on mobile

## Test Strategy
- File exists check
- Component structure verification (ChatInput, ChatHistory, NotificationPanel, TaskContextSidebar)
- SSE connection pattern
- i18n key usage
- Route registration in App.tsx
